# 17. CREATE TABLE — Important Rules

When creating a table, remember:

### Rule 1 — Every column needs a name

```sql
student_id
student_name
age
```

### Rule 2 — Every column needs a data type

```sql
student_id INT
student_name VARCHAR(100)
age INT
```

### Rule 3 — Separate columns using commas

Correct:

```sql
CREATE TABLE students (
    student_id INT,
    student_name VARCHAR(100),
    age INT
);
```

Incorrect:

```sql
CREATE TABLE students (
    student_id INT
    student_name VARCHAR(100)
    age INT
);
```

